n Town"],"), ",["l","深山","the mountain lake"],", or the ocean at ",["l","沙滩","The Beach"],". Fish that can be caught during all seasons are not listed."]],[2,["Even fish that satisfy these two restrictions for appearing on the channel may not appear on the channel in one of more of its respective seasons. Information for 8 fish is provided during spring, 16 during summer, and 12 during fall and winter."]],[1,[["l","鱼#Legendary Fish","Legendary Fish"]," are not listed. The information on how to catch those fish is instead provided in the Lost Book ",["l","遗失之书#Secrets of the Legendary Fish","Secrets of the Legendary Fish"],"."]],[1,["The channel states that ",["l","大比目鱼","Halibut"]," can be caught during 6am-11am during Summer, which is true. However, it can also be caught during nighttime, from 7pm-2am."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}